title: Abolition of the Eight-Hour-Day?
view-if: ruhr_occupied and (spd_in_government == 1 or in_toleration == 1) and year == 1923 and month == 10
max-visits: 1 
priority: 5
tags: event 
new-page: true 
on-arrival: new_middle_dnvp += 3; rural_dnvp += 1; catholic_other += 2; rural_other += 1; old_middle_other += 1
face-image: img/portraits/stinnes_and_the_boyyys.jpg 


= Abolition of the Eight-Hour-Day?

Large industrialists cry about their crisis and loss of profit. The coalition is sure they'll give in to the demand to abolish the constitutional eight hour work day. If we were tu support this measure, the unions and our base would cry out treason, what should we do?

- @co_give_in: The economic situation necsesitates this measure.
- @co_compromise: Perhaps we can reach a compromise?
- @co_reject: Fine, we will end this coalition.
- @to_give_in: The economic situation necsesitates this measure.
- @to_compromise: Perhaps we can reach a compromise?
- @to_reject: Fine, we will end this arrangement.


@co_give_in
subtitle: This is suicide!
view-if: spd_in_government == 1
on-arrival: workers_spd -= 8; unemployed_spd -= 3; new_middle_spd -= 2; eight_hours = 0.5; kpd_relation -= 8; uspd_relation -= 10; sb_relation -= 7; ddp_relation += 6; dvp_relation += 10; z_relation += 4; economic_growth += 0.1; left_dissent += 8; labor_dissent = 8; center_dissent += 4; reformist_dissent += 3; workers_dtsp += 2

Oh boy...


@to_give_in
subtitle: This is suicide!
view-if: in_toleration == 1
on-arrival: workers_spd -= 6; unemployed_spd -= 2; new_middle_spd -= 2; eight_hours = 0.5; kpd_relation -= 8; uspd_relation -= 8; sb_relation -= 8; ddp_relation += 6; dvp_relation += 8; z_relation += 4; economic_growth += 0.1; left_dissent += 8; labor_dissent = 8; center_dissent += 4; reformist_dissent += 3; workers_dtsp += 2

