@co_reject
view-if: spd_in_government == 1
on-arrival: uspd_relation += 3; z_relation -= 1; ddp_relation -= 2; dvp_relation -= 2; early_dvp_cooperation -= 0.5; spd_in_goverment = 0; chancellor = "vacant"; chancellor_party = "I"; ebert_jesters_stressy = 1

The coalition is done. [+ chancellor +] resigns.
  
@to_reject
view-if: in_toleration == 1
on-arrival: uspd_relation += 3; z_relation -= 1; ddp_relation -= 2; dvp_relation -= 2; early_dvp_cooperation -= 0.5; in_toleration = 0; chancellor = "vacant"; chancellor_party = "I"; ebert_jesters_stressy = 1

The coalition is done. [+ chancellor +] resigns.


@co_compromise
view-if: spd_in_government == 1

We could allow for a loosening of the legal framework to up to ten hours while maintaining the eight hour work day in principle.

- @accept: We have to.
- @co_reject: Fine, we will end this coalition.


@to_compromise
view-if: in_toleration == 1

We could allow for a loosening of the legal framework to up to ten hours while maintaining the eight hour work day in principle.

- @accept: We have to.
